#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1439 expect=noViolation domain=VS
#note "Rows 1/2: two baseline flags for the same test differing ONLY in VSPOS (SITTING vs STANDING). PMDA's key set includes --POS -> different assessments -> clean. THE B-twin discriminator: FDA-SD1439's 9-key set has no --POS and would flag both rows. Row 3: single Y-per-key -> clean."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset VS class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col VSSEQ    type=Num
col VSTESTCD type=Char
col VSCAT    type=Char
col VSLOC    type=Char
col VSPOS    type=Char
col VSBLFL   type=Char
---
S1 | VS | S1-001 | 1 | SYSBP | VITALS | ARM | SITTING  | Y
S1 | VS | S1-001 | 2 | SYSBP | VITALS | ARM | STANDING | Y
S1 | VS | S1-001 | 3 | DIABP | VITALS | ARM | SITTING  | Y
